<title>FRANCE: Michelin says no decision on U.S. listing.</title>
<headline>Michelin says no decision on U.S. listing.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michelin has not taken any decision whether to list shares in New York, a spokesman for the tyremaker said on Friday in response to a report that it was considering the move.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the company has been mulling such a move for years, as all large French companies probably have, and there was some debate. But he said no decision had been taken.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
